{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":23,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":3277,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1628207,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":256211,"Name":"valh416","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-256211.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1338999752,"LastPoster":{"Id":286918,"Name":"AdamnJenn17","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286918.jpg?_r=1462901352","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":57,"Preview":{"Id":1913546,"PostDate":1462911805,"PostContent":"For out of counrty weddings (especially ones not in your native tongue) a TA is a must","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"adamphall@ymail.com","IpAddress":"131.137.245.206","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1462886136,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286918.jpg?_r=1462901352","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AdamnJenn17","Id":286918,"Name":"AdamnJenn17","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67940,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5e1bfe0e493473a9602283632c85e969","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I am in the very early stages of planning an Alaskan Cruise wedding in Summer of 2014. I have taken many trips before, and have always booked on my own. I am thinking that with so much that is going to be happening on this trip, and such a large group (there will be 19) maybe I should look into one.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; So I ask, what are the ups and downs to using a travel agent? What does it cost to use a travel agent? Any advice would be helpful!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks&lt;span alt=\":woot2:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot2.gif\"&gt;&lt;img height=\"20\" id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1338995848070_757\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot2.gif\" width=\"40\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1628207,"PostDate":1338999752,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am in the very early stages of planning an Alaskan Cruise wedding in Summer of 2014. I have taken many trips before, and have always booked on my own. I am thinking that with so much that is going to be happening on this trip, and such a large group (there will be 19) maybe I should look into one.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> So I ask, what are the ups and downs to using a travel agent? What does it cost to use a travel agent? Any advice would be helpful!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks<span alt=\":woot2:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot2.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"20\" id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1338995848070_757\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot2.gif\" width=\"40\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"v.hernandez416@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"129.89.103.188","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1338770967,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-256211.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"valh416","Id":256211,"Name":"valh416","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67940,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1397087476,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8e2741cd552cdc5149d6a6f0e87e762f","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Post[size=4]ed by [b]valh416[\/b] [img]http:\/\/\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif[\/img][\/size]\n\n\n[size=4]I am in the very early stages of planning an Alaskan Cruise wedding in Summer of 2014. I have taken many trips before, and have always booked on my own. I am thinking that with so much that is going to be happening on this trip, and such a large group (there will be 19) maybe I should look into one.[\/size]\n\n[size=4]So I ask, what are the ups and downs to using a travel agent? What does it cost to use a travel agent? Any advice would be helpful!![\/size]\n\n[size=4]Thanks[img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot2.gif[\/img][\/size][\/quote][size=4]Hello - I just recently saw your post. Not sure if you received any answers but I&#039;ll share my opinion and hopefully answer your questions. [color=rgb(24,24,24)][font=arial][background=rgb(253,252,250)]Your destination wedding is your special day and everyone wants to get the best rates possible for yourself as well as your guests. Absolutely rates are important, but making sure that you have an advocate working for you is also important. All of the TA&#039;s from the BDW Forum are certified destination wedding &amp;amp; honeymoon specialists. This means we have participated in hours of training, product updates, seminars and site visits where we visit the destinations and properties and tour all aspects of the resort. There are numerous continuing education opportunities each year as well as the opportunity to meet with our local resort and wholesaler representatives. This along with years of experience in working with groups allows us to provide our clients with the best service possible. Part of this service is working to get our clients the best rates possible. My job is to make your job of planning a wedding less stressful and h[\/background][\/font][\/color][font=Arial]andle the travel arrangements for you and your guests. We do not charge any service fees and we are paid by the supplier once travel is complete. [\/font][\/size]\n\n[size=4][color=rgb(24,24,24)][font=arial][background=rgb(253,252,250)]In addition to working with destination wedding groups planning their wedding at a resort I also work with cruise weddings. The same criteria applies to cruises as well. I have been on several cruises in a variety of locations and on a variety of cruise ships. I am a Certified Master Cruise Counselor with CLIA, [i]Cruise Lines International Association[\/i]. In  the past several years cruise lines have become very strict with pricing and do not allow \"discounting\". With this rates should be the same no matter where you book unless an agency has group space. If our agency already has group space on a cruise then we can book into the group and take advantage of any pricing discounts and or perks. If not then I can create a group and block space for your group.  I was in Alaska last fall and it is beautiful. Pricing is available for 2014 on many of the cruise lines and Alaska is a very popular destination. Ships tend to sell out early. Please let me know if I can answer any questions or if you would like any further information. Please feel free to contact me at patty@wrighttravelagency.com. Thanks! TA Patty[\/background][\/font][\/color][\/size]","Attachments":[],"Id":1647387,"PostDate":1343720112,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Post<span  style=\"font-size:14px\">ed by <strong>valh416<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" alt=\"go_quote.gif\"><\/span><\/span><br><br><p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">I am in the very early stages of planning an Alaskan Cruise wedding in Summer of 2014. I have taken many trips before, and have always booked on my own. I am thinking that with so much that is going to be happening on this trip, and such a large group (there will be 19) maybe I should look into one.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">So I ask, what are the ups and downs to using a travel agent? What does it cost to use a travel agent? Any advice would be helpful!!<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Thanks<span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"20\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot2.gif\" width=\"40\" alt=\"woot2.gif\"><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<\/blockquote>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Hello - I just recently saw your post. Not sure if you received any answers but I'll share my opinion and hopefully answer your questions.\u00a0<span  style=\"background-color:rgb(253,252,250);color:rgb(24,24,24);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Your destination wedding is your special day and everyone wants to get the best rates possible for yourself as well as your guests. Absolutely rates are important, but making sure that you have an advocate working for you is also important.\u00a0All of the TA's from the BDW Forum are certified destination wedding & honeymoon specialists. This means we have participated in hours of training, product updates, seminars and site visits where we visit the destinations and properties and tour all aspects of the resort. There are numerous continuing education opportunities each year as well as the opportunity to meet with our local resort and wholesaler representatives. This along with years of experience in working with groups allows us to provide our clients with the best service possible. Part of this service is working to get our clients the best rates possible. My job is to make your job of planning a wedding less stressful and h<\/span><span  style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">andle the travel arrangements for you and your guests. We do not charge any service fees and we are paid by the supplier once travel is complete.\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"background-color:rgb(253,252,250);color:rgb(24,24,24);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">In addition to working with destination wedding groups planning their wedding at a resort I also work with cruise weddings. The same criteria applies to cruises as well. I have been on several cruises in a variety of locations and on a variety of cruise ships. I am a Certified Master Cruise Counselor with CLIA, <em>Cruise Lines International Association<\/em>. In \u00a0the past several years cruise lines have become very strict with pricing and do not allow \"discounting\". With this rates should be the same no matter where you book unless an agency has group space. If our agency already has group space on a cruise then we can book into the group and take advantage of any pricing discounts and or perks. If not then I can create a group and block space for your group. \u00a0I was in Alaska last fall and it is beautiful. Pricing is available for 2014 on many of the cruise lines and Alaska is a very popular destination. Ships tend to sell out early. Please let me know if I can answer any questions or if you would like any further information. Please feel free to contact me at patty@wrighttravelagency.com. Thanks! TA Patty<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews <\/span><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>Awards and recognition: <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency | <\/span><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner | Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"patty@wrighttravelagency.com","IpAddress":"76.95.92.213","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1278661080,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230028.jpg?_r=1398727965","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TA Patty","Id":230028,"Name":"TA Patty","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67940,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dcf3d52962aac19e7bcda8fd99b476f4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m using a travel agent for our destination wedding. So far there are no cons to using her. There is no out of pocket cost to us to use her, she earns commission off those who book through her.&amp;nbsp; My main reason for using her is because she works directly with the wedding coordinator at the resort and saves me a lot of time trying to contact them, get answers about things etc.&amp;nbsp; The other reason is because some family that will be going is older and not good with internet, etc so they can call her and she can handle all their booking needs. With that said, my guests still have the option to book on their own through another search engine if they choose.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1647432,"PostDate":1343745605,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm using a travel agent for our destination wedding. So far there are no cons to using her. There is no out of pocket cost to us to use her, she earns commission off those who book through her.\u00a0 My main reason for using her is because she works directly with the wedding coordinator at the resort and saves me a lot of time trying to contact them, get answers about things etc.\u00a0 The other reason is because some family that will be going is older and not good with internet, etc so they can call her and she can handle all their booking needs. With that said, my guests still have the option to book on their own through another search engine if they choose.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Ddmaust@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1341333233,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257411.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"safety75","Id":257411,"Name":"safety75","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67940,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b9c9ed191a094f656187f1ebeeb76a84","RawContent":"Once I create a room block, do my guests have to reserve\/book through the TA for the rooms\/guest night benefits to count for me? Or can they book elsewhere and reference the group rate? In your experience have your guests found cheaper rates than the group rates? If so, was your TA able to match\/beat the lower rate? Did it count towards your freebie wedding benefits? Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":1797429,"PostDate":1378291617,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Once I create a room block, do my guests have to reserve\/book through the TA for the rooms\/guest night benefits to count for me? Or can they book elsewhere and reference the group rate? In your experience have your guests found cheaper rates than the group rates? If so, was your TA able to match\/beat the lower rate? Did it count towards your freebie wedding benefits? Thanks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hcwedding@comcast.net","IpAddress":"71.202.67.103","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1378279855,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273197.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lastminbride","Id":273197,"Name":"lastminbride","