 Only because of cheaper prices of course.","Attachments":[],"Id":1798301,"PostDate":1378602492,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks. Any idea on the if I still get wedding perks (count towards my group room nights) if my guests choose to book through someone other than a (my) chosen TA? Only because of cheaper prices of course.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hcwedding@comcast.net","IpAddress":"71.202.67.103","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1378279855,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273197.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lastminbride","Id":273197,"Name":"lastminbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67940,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1ef0cb0f7b507ac5ffc286f7ac7b6654","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;lastminbride&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n Thanks. Any idea on the if I still get wedding perks (count towards my group room nights) if my guests choose to book through someone other than a (my) chosen TA? Only because of cheaper prices of course.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;I booked my own blocked rooms and since we are Hilton Honors we will receive a few perks. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1798345,"PostDate":1378619955,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>lastminbride<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Thanks. Any idea on the if I still get wedding perks (count towards my group room nights) if my guests choose to book through someone other than a (my) chosen TA? Only because of cheaper prices of course.<\/div> <\/div> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>I booked my own blocked rooms and since we are Hilton Honors we will receive a few perks. \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tracynichols@sbcglobal.net","IpAddress":"99.89.189.10","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1264844841,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225165.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"traylynn","Id":225165,"Name":"traylynn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67940,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e10802c0fe0209fd99cdfe4428f7c93b","RawContent":"Traylynn - that&#039;s a good tip. Which resort did you choose? Thx","Attachments":[],"Id":1798353,"PostDate":1378628752,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Traylynn - that's a good tip. Which resort did you choose? Thx\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hcwedding@comcast.net","IpAddress":"71.202.67.103","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1378279855,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273197.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lastminbride","Id":273197,"Name":"lastminbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67940,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a5dfa6f148290e2f94ebeb91b5d58ceb","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;lastminbride&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n Traylynn - that&#039;s a good tip. Which resort did you choose? Thx&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;It is not a resort, we need a few a day or two when we arrive I selected the Doubletree&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1798388,"PostDate":1378654303,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>lastminbride<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Traylynn - that's a good tip. Which resort did you choose? Thx<\/div> <\/div> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>It is not a resort, we need a few a day or two when we arrive I selected the Doubletree<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tracynichols@sbcglobal.net","IpAddress":"99.89.189.10","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1264844841,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225165.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"traylynn","Id":225165,"Name":"traylynn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67940,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"37d23e10855e9ef90c0c840e7c8e9df7","RawContent":"[quote name=\"traylynn\"]\nIt is not a resort, we need a few a day or two when we arrive I selected the Doubletree[\/quote] Ok. :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1798413,"PostDate":1378665012,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"traylynn\" url=\"\/t\/80228\/to&#045;use&#045;a&#045;travel&#045;agent&#045;or&#045;not#post_1946458\"><p>It is not a resort, we need a few a day or two when we arrive I selected the Doubletree<\/p><\/blockquote> Ok. <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hcwedding@comcast.net","IpAddress":"71.202.67.103","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1378279855,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273197.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lastminbride","Id":273197,"Name":"lastminbride","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"67940","Title":"To use a travel agent or not??","LastPostDate":1462911805},"Pages":{"TotalItems":23,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
